sections.text:
Note that images are taken from the high definition format whenever possible.
Some variants were carried over from the standard definition format and slightly rearranged for the HD widescreen ratio. Those differences are minimal, and thus not showcased on this gallery.

Boat scene 

This scene features a camera effect that zooms out from 's eye, moves to an upper view while rotating in 360° around the boat, then ends with a zoom in to 's eye. The following images are taken from one of the few frames in which all the characters are visible at the same time. Click on each picture for a larger view.

